## Original Content
Antes de ser advogado, Agostinho Pereira de Miranda foi inspetor da PJ, tendo investigado o caso do atentado à bomba contra a Embaixada de Cuba em 1976. 2.ª parte de uma longa conversa com Luís Rosa.

## Summary
Agostinho Pereira de Miranda, a former PJ inspector, recounts investigating the 1976 bomb attack on the Cuban Embassy and reveals that Cuban intelligence attempted to recruit him during that time. This is the second part of a long conversation with Luís Rosa.

## Key Points
- Agostinho Pereira de Miranda served as a PJ inspector before becoming a lawyer.
- He was involved in the investigation of the 1976 bomb attack on the Cuban Embassy.
- Cuban intelligence services tried to recruit him in 1976.
- The content is an excerpt from a personal interview or conversation.


